# Live AgentControl E2E harnesses. Internal-only for two reasons: they are
# hardwired to a dev box (localhost:8741 FastAPI + localhost:8744 node, one
# fixed tenant UUID) so they cannot run for anyone else, and they carry real
# login credentials inline. The published examples are examples/Example.java
# and examples/example.cpp, which take everything from env.
typescript/e2e_agentcontrol.mjs
python/ac_e2e.py
python/ac_serving_pipelines.py
cpp/run_ac_test.sh
cpp/examples/ac_test.cpp
java/examples/AgentControlTest.java

